    "detailed_description": "<strong>Murder in Omar's Burger</strong> is an immersive <strong>2-4 players</strong> game set in a burger restaurant gripped by a murder mystery. <br>Take on the role of a <strong>Detective</strong> or <strong>Killer</strong> in each game, and challenge your detective and stealth skills with your friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Detective</strong></h2>You are investigating a burger restaurant to find a murder suspect.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209930/extras/8ec12420e12615217575c32b6b5d6bc5.poster.avif?t=1710367820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209930/extras/8ec12420e12615217575c32b6b5d6bc5.webm?t=1710367820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209930/extras/8ec12420e12615217575c32b6b5d6bc5.mp4?t=1710367820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find and shoot the killer among employees!<br></li><li>Search for evidence to gather clues about the killer.<br></li><li>If you shoot the wrong person, you lose.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Killer</strong></h2>Hide the evidence and kill the detective before he figures out who you are.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209930/extras/a3589aaab0ed52d349cbad471138c019.poster.avif?t=1710367820\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209930/extras/a3589aaab0ed52d349cbad471138c019.webm?t=1710367820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2209930/extras/a3589aaab0ed52d349cbad471138c019.mp4?t=1710367820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hide all the evidence before the detective shows up.<br></li><li>Keep working jobs to avoid drawing attention.<br></li><li>You can use power cuts to sneak behind the detective.<br></li><li>Watch for an opportunity to attack or switch the evidence's place.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Sneak </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The Killer can be anyone among the restaurant employees.<br></li><li>Work among other employees to avoid attention.<br></li><li>The Killer can freely move during a power cut, while the detective must be extra careful.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Mods </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1 VS 1<br></li><li>2 VS 2</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The appearance of the killer is randomly generated in every game.</li></ul>",
