Hide all the evidence before the detective shows up.<br></li><li>Keep working jobs to avoid drawing attention.<br></li><li>You can use power cuts to sneak behind the detective.<br></li><li>Watch for an opportunity to attack or switch the evidence's place.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Sneak </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The Killer can be anyone among the restaurant employees.<br></li><li>Work among other employees to avoid attention.<br></li><li>The Killer can freely move during a power cut, while the detective must be extra careful.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Mods </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1 VS 1<br></li><li>2 VS 2</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The appearance of the killer is randomly generated in every game.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Murder in Omar's Burger is a social deduction game for 2-4 players, set in a restaurant where a murder has occurred. The Detective is trying to find the killer among the employees. The killer hides evidence and keeps a low profile in order to sneak up on the detective and stab him.",
